    '564a68d42463b3e3b526d875970dd631da2e3eec': b'tree 57903a2751483c8b6e1aaa3879dce8173e77d647\nparent e90e15fa8b6d527006b6c62a75eb2fcab6629f0f\nauthor Eswlnk <1525566427@qq.com> 1791427639 +0800\ncommitter Eswlnk <1525566427@qq.com> 1791427639 +0800\n\nfixed: \xf0\x9f\x90\x9b \xe4\xb8\xba\xe5\xbd\x92\xe6\xa1\xa3\xe8\xa7\xa3\xe6\x9e\x90\xe7\xbb\xa7\xe6\x89\xbf\xe5\x8f\x91\xe5\xb8\x83\xe9\xa2\x84\xe7\xae\x97\n\n\xe5\x9c\xa8 FINAL ZIP \xe4\xb8\x8e\xe4\xba\x91\xe7\xab\xaf tar \xe7\x9a\x84\xe6\x97\xa2\xe6\x9c\x89\xe8\xaf\xbb\xe5\x86\x99\xe5\x92\x8c\xe8\xa7\xa3\xe5\x8e\x8b\xe5\xbe\xaa\xe7\x8e\xaf\xe4\xb8\xad\xe6\xa3\x80\xe6\x9f\xa5\xe5\x8e\x9f\xe5\xa7\x8b\xe6\x88\xaa\xe6\xad\xa2\xe6\x97\xb6\xe9\x97\xb4\xe4\xb8\x8e\xe5\x8f\x96\xe6\xb6\x88\xe5\x9b\x9e\xe8\xb0\x83\xef\xbc\x8c\xe4\xbf\x9d\xe7\x95\x99\xe9\xbb\x98\xe8\xae\xa4\xe8\xb0\x83\xe7\x94\xa8\xe3\x80\x81\xe9\x94\x99\xe8\xaf\xaf\xe4\xbc\x98\xe5\x85\x88\xe7\xba\xa7\xe5\x8f\x8a\xe8\xb5\x84\xe6\xba\x90\xe6\x89\x80\xe6\x9c\x89\xe6\x9d\x83\xe3\x80\x82\n',
    '110b4febbbcdab0138e2d28de2a53e2f2d61d7d6': b"tree 485ef3e3a781201b63d92ea0acf958ac89cc5211\nparent 0def59d1ac429d5dd53bc4b75b626f5e4811d414\nauthor Eswlnk <1525566427@qq.com> 1791496141 +0800\ncommitter Eswlnk <1525566427@qq.com> 1791496141 +0800\n\nfixed: \xf0\x9f\x90\x9b seal bounded RC fixture readiness and source guards\n\nPrepare the fixed backpressure and five loopback fixtures before the original\nphase clock. Bind the actual child's post-R PID, configuration and mode; leave\nR unread, issue no request and hand off the same process once. Detach the actual\ndeletion finalizer and retain the whole owner after uncertain disposal.\n\nPin the three exact historical Stage/Checksum identities and preserve every\noriginal assertion through complete finite source inverses. Seal D4/D3/D2/D750\nancestry, 1849 source entries and the 3411-line delta within existing budgets.\n\nValidation: 162 exact-source focused tests and 12 real component cases passed\nwithout skips; independent source review and staged GitNexus scope checked.\nFresh native CI and complete D/I/J qualification remain required.\n\nRefs: #88",
